ivalent absolute downstream boundary calibrated to the published total head.","Table 2 labels density as berat jenis crude even though the fluid service is hot water. The model follows the numeric density 965 kg/m3 from the journal.","The full manufacturer curve is shown graphically but not digitized in the text. The pump curve in this file is an engineering fit from the calculated operating point and design data."],"appOnlyAssumptions":["Downstream SNK pressure is an equivalent closure boundary so the application required-head calculation equals the journal operating head 37.674 m at Q = 39.68 m3/h.","The suction strainer is represented as an equivalent K value derived from the journal strainer loss hstr = 0.00415 m.","Commercial steel roughness is represented as 0.0018 inch / 0.00004572 m, matching the journal relative roughness basis.","Pump efficiency and NPSHr between the operating and design points are linearly represented by the application curve interpolation because the full curve data table is not supplied."],"detailedAnalysisReport":{"reportFile":"journals/analysis-reports/simulasi-6-analysis.json","markdownFile":"journals/simulasi_6/audit_validasi_Evaluasi_Pompa_Sentrifugal_P-2941A_sebagai_Pompa_Air_Panas.md","comparisonRowCount":63,"largestDeviationMetric":"Pipe Discharge - eps/D","largestDeviationPercent":1.10318,"status":"Conditionally validated with documented journal caveats and equivalent closures"},"optimizePumpFromNetwork":{"runAt":"2026-05-22T12:42:44.159Z","readinessStatus":"Ready","canRun":true,"proposalStatus":"Proposal Ready","canApply":true,"appliedToPumpInputs":false,"targetFlowM3H":39.68,"requiredSystemHeadM":37.674,"npshaAtDesignM":15.358,"maxAllowableNpshrM":15.349,"proposedNpshrM":14.582,"retainedJournalNpshrM":1,"decision":"Optimization proposal is recorded for engineering review; journal/literature duty inputs are retained for validation."}},"systemCompatibility":{"schemaVersion":"untirta-project-current-system-upgrade.v1","upgradedA